---
Live values of your devices as they arrive. Full-screen view, q quits.
--plain prints one line per value instead (good for logs and pipes).
Needs a browser or device login.

Usage: hn watch [OPTIONS] [SENSORS]...

Arguments:
  [SENSORS]...  Only these sensors (ids or names), default all

Options:
      --plain  One line per value instead of the full-screen view
  -h, --help   Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn watch
  hn watch <sensor-id> <sensor-id>
  hn watch --plain | grep TEMPERATURE
